Nexus-panel is derived from flux-panel by bqlpfy:
https://github.com/bqlpfy/flux-panel
Source baseline: main, commit 9b5ccdb (2026-09-26 checkout).

The Flux panel frontend, Spring Boot backend and SQL schema remain under
the Apache License 2.0. The copyright and license notices in those sources
and the root LICENSE are retained. Nexus-panel changes include branding,
source builds, the panel installer, domain configuration and SSH menu.

The node-side GOST implementation is not included or modified here.
The original bundled SIMSUN.TTC font is replaced at build time with the
distribution's Noto CJK font for the existing CAPTCHA feature.
